    "created_at": "2025-03-23T13:54:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-23T13:54:37Z",
    "body": "I'd suggest leaving it at \"The q element represents some quoted phrasing content\".\n\nA `q` element that is for some quotations but not others is counterintuitive. This is evidenced by MDN, W3Schools, GeeksForGeeks, and other secondary sources about the `q` element that appear at the top of search results for it. They all say that the `q` element is for quotations, without any further qualification.\n\nOf course, this line of reasoning extends to the `blockquote` element as well.",
